{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And he shall have no inheritance.</b> It is written in the Sifrei: ״ונחלה לא יהיה לו״ — this is the inheritance of the rest. The Rav explains: ״בכור שור״ — this is the rest of the brothers: Dan and Naphtali, Gad and Asher, and Benjamin, Ephraim and Manasseh. ״בקרב אחיו״ — this is the inheritance of the five: Reuben, Simeon, Judah, Issachar and Zebulun, who were Levi's brothers from the same mother — and even so, he does not take an inheritance with them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:04.592444407Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}